{"architectures":["neutral","x64"],"id":"Game1024.OpenSpeedy","latestVersion":"3.3.17","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"🎮 An open-source game speed modifier.[一款开源的游戏变速器]","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Wiki","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/wiki"}],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"🎮 An open-source game speed modifier.[一款开源的游戏变速器]","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Wiki","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/wiki"}],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","name":"OpenSpeedy","packageUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy","publisher":"Game1024","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/game1024","releaseNotes":"⌨️ 小键盘按键现在可以作为快捷键\n之前小键盘的数字键会和主键盘上排的数字键记成同一个键。按下小键盘 1，\n实际被记录成主键盘的「1」，于是注册的是主键盘那个键 —— 你再按小键盘自然毫无反应。\nNumLock 关闭时更糟：系统报告的是 End / 方向键，会注册成一个完全无关的键。\n现在改为读取物理键位，小键盘的按键会被正确识别为独立的键：\n- 数字键 0–9\n- +、-、*、/、. 和小键盘回车\n由于是按键位识别，NumLock 开或关都能正确录制。\n两点平台限制（非本应用可控）：\n- 小键盘回车在 Windows 上与主键盘回车是同一个虚拟键，无法区分\n- 小键盘「等于」键存在上游映射错误，会被直接拒绝并提示，而不是静默注册成字母 E\n界面上的显示会区分开来，例如小键盘的 1 显示为 Num1，主键盘的 1 显示为 1。\n\n🐛 修复：设置页里注册的档位快捷键看似不生效\n在设置页录制一个档位快捷键后，按下它游戏倍速确实会变，但应用里显示的倍速数字\n不动，看起来就像快捷键没生效。重启应用后却又正常了。\n原因是设置页注册和启动时注册用了两份不同的回调，前者漏了更新界面倍速这一步。\n现在两者已统一。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/releases/tag/3.3.17","tags":["cplusplus","gamedev","gamemod","pc","qt","speed-engine","toolkit","windows"]}},"name":"OpenSpeedy","packageUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy","publisher":"Game1024","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/game1024","releaseNotes":"⌨️ 小键盘按键现在可以作为快捷键\n之前小键盘的数字键会和主键盘上排的数字键记成同一个键。按下小键盘 1，\n实际被记录成主键盘的「1」，于是注册的是主键盘那个键 —— 你再按小键盘自然毫无反应。\nNumLock 关闭时更糟：系统报告的是 End / 方向键，会注册成一个完全无关的键。\n现在改为读取物理键位，小键盘的按键会被正确识别为独立的键：\n- 数字键 0–9\n- +、-、*、/、. 和小键盘回车\n由于是按键位识别，NumLock 开或关都能正确录制。\n两点平台限制（非本应用可控）：\n- 小键盘回车在 Windows 上与主键盘回车是同一个虚拟键，无法区分\n- 小键盘「等于」键存在上游映射错误，会被直接拒绝并提示，而不是静默注册成字母 E\n界面上的显示会区分开来，例如小键盘的 1 显示为 Num1，主键盘的 1 显示为 1。\n\n🐛 修复：设置页里注册的档位快捷键看似不生效\n在设置页录制一个档位快捷键后，按下它游戏倍速确实会变，但应用里显示的倍速数字\n不动，看起来就像快捷键没生效。重启应用后却又正常了。\n原因是设置页注册和启动时注册用了两份不同的回调，前者漏了更新界面倍速这一步。\n现在两者已统一。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/game1024/OpenSpeedy/releases/tag/3.3.17","tags":["cplusplus","gamedev","gamemod","pc","qt","speed-engine","toolkit","windows"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["neutral"],"detailPath":"versions/3.3.17/app.json","detailSha256":"86181fd7beda0d2a38e0cadf090a6fe5f3325a83e43fa48919d30fb8dccc8eaa","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"3.3.17"},{"architectures":["neutral"],"detailPath":"versions/3.3.10/app.json","detailSha256":"bbdb15828cdf7e884d57c49c7f02797007ccc71761ce056c04d3d4179b41952d","releaseDate":"2026-09-12","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.3.10"},{"architectures":["neutral"],"detailPath":"versions/3.3.8/app.json","detailSha256":"186ae1c7efe9cd78a47c7093676f8bcd8a57e245c5ad49bb65128b4b8e712cd3","releaseDate":"2026-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.3.8"},{"architectures":["neutral"],"detailPath":"versions/3.3.7/app.json","detailSha256":"37a80a43d09dcd4e8e50042041a2b75570a23d8bdb43bf26d805c2df2791657a","releaseDate":"2026-07-26","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.3.7"},{"architectures":["neutral"],"detailPath":"versions/3.3.6/app.json","detailSha256":"92d074d6cd915e8a9abf67d178f7e783c165cb0a49fb8d7868804a8cbcf0628b","releaseDate":"2026-07-21","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.3.6"},{"architectures":["neutral"],"detailPath":"versions/3.3.5/app.json","detailSha256":"10320172c06d22cba54f840638492a9278d16488fed0c4ee33ccff5db4104ddf","releaseDate":"2026-07-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.3.5"},{"architectures":["neutral"],